            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>In a recent study, Satar et al. (Bioprocess Biosyst Eng 39:807-814, 2016) have reported &quot;the synthesis and characterization of graphene for the immobilization of β-galactosidase for improved galacto-oligosaccharide (GOS) production&quot;. There are several issues in this study that must be commented.</AbstractText>
